{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And you shall divide the spoil.</b> Because this war was a war of vengeance for what had been done against all of them, He desired that וְאָכַלְתָּ אֶת שְׁלַל אֹיְבֶיךָ (Deuteronomy 20:14) be fulfilled among all of them — as with David regarding the spoil of Amalek, as it says: הִנֵּה לָכֶם בְּרָכָה מִשְּׁלַל אֹיְבֵי ה׳ (1 Samuel 30:26)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:27.155969793Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}